commit ec43279379d293de970671badbf006c51f283b09

C03: the absence of a program the person wants to work in is stated alone (APPS1673)

APPS1671 measured the use-to-do presence read for Photoshop: every draft added a failure consequence («no puedo editarte la foto», «no pude abrirlo», «so it cannot be opened») that the narrator vetoed as an asserted failure or the App rejected as a reversed result, and two turns ended without a useful reply. Under a use-to-do request (editar, retocar, usar, trabajar and their English forms, with no open verb) the app.installed narration bit now asks for the fact alone: the program is not in the Windows Start catalog of this PC, no cannot/failed, no offer to install or search.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


